## How It Works

| Trigger | Claude Action |
|---------|---------------|
| Session starts | Calls `state_init_session` + `memory_context` |
| Bug/error described | Searches `memory_search_patterns` for solutions |
| Error encountered | Searches `memory_search` with type="error" |
| Problem solved | Stores solution with `memory_store` |
| Code changes | Searches for related past decisions |
| Before complex work | Calls `context_refresh` for grounding |
| Referencing a file | Calls `verify_entity` to confirm |
| Making decisions | Auto-logged via `timeline_auto_detect` |
| Using stored knowledge | Mentions "Based on stored memory..." |

